<title>USA: MidAmerican Energy sets $2.2 mln ad effort.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican Energy sets $2.2 mln ad effort.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Co said Monday it initiated a $2.2 million advertising campaign to establish its brand identity.</p>
<p>The campaign, initially geared to television, will be expanded to include print advertisements. It was developed by Clarity Coverdale Fury, a Minneapolis advertising agency.</p>
<p>MidAmerican Energy provides electric and gas service in Iowa, Illinois, Nebraska and South Dakota.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
